    "created_at": "2019-01-09T10:05:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-09T10:05:59Z",
    "body": "Indeed, I don't think we want an algorithm that produces a \"composed tree\" within which you can then traverse. We want specific traversal operations within the existing node tree, such as \"composed-parent\", \"composed-child\", etc.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
