    "updated_at": "2026-06-10T11:39:06Z",
    "body": "A thing I realized only now is that \"composed parent\" is trivial, but \"composed child\" is tricky as you can have a child in multiple trees. But maybe we just start with \"composed parent\" and see where that takes us.",
